  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Inhibitor is a cocktail of neurochemicals that block some brain receptor and transmitter functions in an attempt to reduce psi-waves and block or impair sleights. This drug is commonly used to restrain async prisoners from using their abilities. Make a WIL Check at -20. If you fail, lose all psi abilities for the drug&rsquo;s duration. If you succeed, you still suffer a -30 modifier to Psi Tests. Inhibitor-influenced characters have a glazed, dopey expression and difficulty getting excited or emotional.</p>",
